  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (amending A.R.S. 13-3102, subsection A, new paragraph 17): {+17. FAILING TO SECURE A FIREARM FROM A MINOR BY NOT TAKING REASONABLE MEASURES TO PREVENT THE MINOR FROM ACCESSING THE FIREARM.+}\nSec. 1 (amending A.R.S. 13-3102, new subsection K): {+K. SUBSECTION A, PARAGRAPH 17 OF THIS SECTION SHALL NOT APPLY IF A MINOR HAS LAWFUL POSSESSION OF A FIREARM PURSUANT TO SECTION 13-3111.+}\nSec. 1 (amending A.R.S. 13-3102, subsection N): {+MISCONDUCT INVOLVING WEAPONS UNDER SUBSECTION A, PARAGRAPH 17 OF THIS SECTION IS A CLASS 6 FELONY IF THE MINOR ACCESSES THE FIREARM AND A CLASS 4 FELONY IF THE MINOR DISCHARGES THE FIREARM AND CAUSES DEATH OR SERIOUS PHYSICAL INJURY TO THE MINOR OR ANOTHER PERSON.+}"
}